<title>INDONESIA: Kohl leaves Indonesia after four-day visit.</title>
<headline>Kohl leaves Indonesia after four-day visit.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl left Indonesia for the Philippines on Tuesday at the end of a four-day visit, officials said.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the German embassy said Kohl left on a special flight from Jakarta's Halim military airbase along with a delegation of ministers and businessmen.</p>
<p>Kohl arrived in Jakarta on Saturday and held official talks with President Suharto on Monday. He is due to visit Japan after the Philippines.</p>
</text>
